{%- comment %}
  "Customize this build" popup for the GymBuild PDP
  (sections/main-product-ab-test-asjads-pdp.liquid only).
  Figma: file XBaAGVhSupd0fvIcXd28qw, node 4539:86140.

  Opened via a <modal-opener data-modal="#GymBuildCustomizeModal-{{ section.id }}">
  wrapped around the existing "Customize this build" button in the main
  section file. Reuses Dawn's <modal-dialog> custom element
  (assets/global.js) for open/close/focus-trap/ESC/backdrop-click — no new
  JS needed for that part.

  IMPORTANT: <modal-dialog>'s connectedCallback moves this element to be a
  direct child of <body> at runtime. That means none of its CSS can rely on
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} scoping (it won't be nested under the
  section wrapper by the time it's shown) — every rule below is a plain,
  globally-scoped .gymbuild-customize-drawer* class instead, same approach
  section-main-product.css already uses for .product-popup-modal.

  P0 (see CLAUDE.md, this popup is the original target of the Hard P0
  Rules): footer says "Estimated equipment subtotal" (never "Total"), no
  "shipping calculated at checkout" copy. Per explicit direction, the
  submit button keeps Figma's "Request Quote Review" label rather than
  "View selected build" (that label is for the PDP-level entry point that
  opens this popup, not this internal action) — everything is visual-only,
  nothing submits or mutates a cart.

  DATA SOURCE (Phase 2, wired 2026-09-21) — the "Package Inclusions"
  tabs/grid below read the real metaobject-backed model. Nothing here is
  placeholder any more; the earlier add_on_product stand-in (grouped by a
  fabricated "Mats"/"Storage Racks"/"Other Accessories" taxonomy) was
  removed on 2026-09-03 and must NOT be restored.

    current_variant.metafields.custom.gymbuild_items  (list of gymbuild_item)
      gymbuild_item.category             -> gymbuild_category { name }
      gymbuild_item.default_option       -> gymbuild_option { variant, quantity }
      gymbuild_item.alternative_options  -> list of gymbuild_option

  Tab labels come from gymbuild_category.name; tab ORDER is the order each
  category first appears in the variant's item list (there is deliberately
  no sort field). Prices, weights, SKUs, titles and images are all read
  live off the referenced product variant — never stored in the metaobjects
  and never hard-coded here. See gymbuild-data-model.md (what the types are)
  and gymbuild-data-population.md (every GID, and the interim flooring
  caveat: FF-RIT24-Middle currently stands in for the full tile count).

  Because the size cards navigate to variant.url, this lookup re-scopes per
  package size on its own — no client-side state is needed for size changes.

  TEXT FIELDS ARE READ VIA A capture BLOCK, not `.value`: rendering a
  metaobject text/integer field always yields its raw value, which keeps
  handleize/plus/escape working on a real string regardless of how the
  field drop coerces. Reference fields use the documented `.value`.

  SWAP INTERACTION (Figma node 4544:92078): clicking "Swap" on an included
  card switches the drawer body + header into a "Swap to:" sub-view (same
  drawer, no new modal — toggled via the .is-swap-view class on
  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__content), showing alternatives with a price
  delta (+/- $X). "Back to build" returns to the main tabs/grid.
{% endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign gymbuild_items = current_variant.metafields.custom.gymbuild_items.value
-%}

<modal-dialog id="GymBuildCustomizeModal-{{ section.id }}" class="gymbuild-customize-drawer">
  <div
    role="dialog"
    aria-label="Customize this build"
    aria-modal="true"
    class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__content"
    tabindex="-1"
  >
    <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__header">
      <h2 class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__title">Customize this build</h2>
      <button type="button" class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__back" data-gymbuild-back>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
        Back to build
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        id="ModalClose-GymBuildCustomize-{{ section.id }}"
        class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__close"
        aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.close' | t }}"
      >
        {% render 'icon-close' %}
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__body">
      {%- comment -%}
        ==================================================================
        TEMPORARY DEV BANNER — DELETE THIS WHOLE BLOCK (markup START)
        ------------------------------------------------------------------
        Added 2026-09-21 while the GymBuild build tool is unapproved. It
        sits directly inside __body, OUTSIDE __main-view and __swap-view,
        so it stays visible in the swap sub-view too.

        To remove: delete from this comment to the matching "markup END"
        marker below, then delete the matching CSS block in this file's style
        block (search for the same TEMPORARY DEV BANNER marker). The
        same pair exists in gymbuild-quote-review-popup.liquid — remove
        both. Nothing else references .gymbuild-dev-banner.

        Copy is deliberately narrow: it says the numbers are provisional.
        It does NOT call the products fake — they are real French Fitness
        products at real prices. What is provisional is the package
        composition (e.g. flooring is still the FF-RIT24-Middle interim
        stand-in) and the fact that none of it is approved yet. This is
        new customer-facing copy and needs human review per CLAUDE.md
        non-negotiable #7.
        ==================================================================
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gymbuild-dev-banner" role="status">
        <span class="gymbuild-dev-banner__icon">{% render 'icon-alert' %}</span>
        <span>
          <strong>Under development — for testing only.</strong>
          Package contents, prices and weights shown here are provisional and not final.
        </span>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%} TEMPORARY DEV BANNER — DELETE THIS WHOLE BLOCK (markup END) {%- endcomment -%}

      <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__main-view">
      {% if product.variants.size > 1 %}
        <fieldset class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-cards" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ product.options_with_values.first.name }}">
          <legend class="visually-hidden">{{ product.options_with_values.first.name }}</legend>
          {% for variant in product.variants %}
            <label class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card{% if variant.id == current_variant.id %} is-selected{% endif %}{% unless variant.available %} is-soldout{% endunless %}">
              <input
                type="radio"
                class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card-input"
                name="GymBuildCustomizeSize-{{ section.id }}"
                value="{{ variant.id }}"
                data-variant-url="{{ variant.url }}"
                {% if variant.id == current_variant.id %}checked{% endif %}
                {% unless variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}
              >
              <span class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card-title">{{ variant.title }}</span>
              {%- if variant.metafields.custom.size_description != blank -%}
                <span class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card-desc">{{ variant.metafields.custom.size_description }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card-price">Starting at {{ variant.price | money }}</span>
            </label>
          {% endfor %}
        </fieldset>
      {% endif %}

      {% if gymbuild_items != blank %}
        <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Package inclusion categories">
          {%- liquid
            assign rendered_tabs = ''
            assign tab_index = 0
          -%}
          {% for gb_item in gymbuild_items %}
            {%- liquid
              capture tab_heading
                echo gb_item.category.value.name
              endcapture
              if tab_heading == blank
                assign tab_heading = 'Included'
              endif
              assign tab_key = tab_heading | handleize

              capture tab_token
                echo '|'
                echo tab_key
                echo '|'
              endcapture
            -%}

            {% unless rendered_tabs contains tab_token %}
              <button
                type="button"
                class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__tab{% if tab_index == 0 %} is-active{% endif %}"
                role="tab"
                aria-selected="{% if tab_index == 0 %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                aria-controls="GymBuildInclusionsPanel-{{ section.id }}-{{ tab_key }}"
                id="GymBuildInclusionsTab-{{ section.id }}-{{ tab_key }}"
                data-tab="{{ tab_key }}"
              >
                {{ tab_heading }}
              </button>

              {%- liquid
                assign rendered_tabs = rendered_tabs | append: tab_token
                assign tab_index = tab_index | plus: 1
              -%}
            {% endunless %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__panels">
          {%- liquid
            assign rendered_panels = ''
            assign panel_index = 0
          -%}

          {% for gb_item in gymbuild_items %}
            {%- liquid
              capture panel_heading
                echo gb_item.category.value.name
              endcapture
              if panel_heading == blank
                assign panel_heading = 'Included'
              endif
              assign panel_key = panel_heading | handleize

              capture panel_token
                echo '|'
                echo panel_key
                echo '|'
              endcapture
            -%}

            {% unless rendered_panels contains panel_token %}
              <div
                class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__panel{% if panel_index == 0 %} is-active{% endif %}"
                id="GymBuildInclusionsPanel-{{ section.id }}-{{ panel_key }}"
                role="tabpanel"
                aria-labelledby="GymBuildInclusionsTab-{{ section.id }}-{{ panel_key }}"
                data-panel="{{ panel_key }}"
                {% unless panel_index == 0 %}hidden{% endunless %}
              >
                <p class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__panel-heading">Package Inclusions:</p>
                <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__grid">
                  {% for card_item in gymbuild_items %}
                    {%- liquid
                      capture card_tab_heading
                        echo card_item.category.value.name
                      endcapture
                      if card_tab_heading == blank
                        assign card_tab_heading = 'Included'
                      endif
                      assign card_tab_key = card_tab_heading | handleize

                      assign inclusion_option = card_item.default_option.value
                      assign inclusion_variant = inclusion_option.variant.value
                    -%}

                    {% if card_tab_key == panel_key and inclusion_variant != blank %}
                      {%- liquid
                        # Quantity comes off gymbuild_option.quantity, read via capture
                        # (see the snippet header) so it is a real string before | plus.
                        # Floor at 1: the definition enforces min 1, so a 0 here can only
                        # mean the field failed to resolve, and falling back to 1 degrades
                        # to the pre-Phase-2 behaviour instead of zeroing a line out of
                        # the subtotal entirely.
                        capture inclusion_qty_raw
                          echo inclusion_option.quantity
                        endcapture
                        assign inclusion_qty = inclusion_qty_raw | plus: 0
                        if inclusion_qty < 1
                          assign inclusion_qty = 1
                        endif

                        # gymbuild_option references a VARIANT, so title / sku / price /
                        # weight all come off the real variant record. Most French Fitness
                        # products are single-variant ("Default Title"), where the product
                        # title alone is the customer-facing name; only append the variant
                        # title when it actually distinguishes something (FF-RIT24
                        # "Middle", or FF-MSS-48-3T Single Compact 3-Tier).
                        assign inclusion_title = inclusion_variant.product.title
                        unless inclusion_variant.title == 'Default Title'
                          assign inclusion_title = inclusion_title | append: ' - ' | append: inclusion_variant.title
                        endunless

                        # Most referenced variants carry no variant-level image, so fall
                        # back to the parent product's featured image.
                        assign inclusion_image = inclusion_variant.featured_image
                        if inclusion_image == blank
                          assign inclusion_image = inclusion_variant.product.featured_image
                        endif
                        assign inclusion_image_url = inclusion_image | image_url: width: 300

                        assign alternative_options = card_item.alternative_options.value

                        # alternative_count is incremented inside the pool capture below
                        # rather than read off a .count property, so the Swap button's
                        # enabled state is driven by what was actually emitted. The old
                        # check was a string test for a comma in the pool JSON, which
                        # matched EVERY pool (each entry has commas between its own
                        # fields), so the button rendered enabled on non-swappable items
                        # and then did nothing when clicked.
                        assign alternative_count = 0

                        # data-item-pool carries the default FIRST, then every alternative.
                        # price is in cents and weight is the variant's shipping weight in
                        # GRAMS (variant.weight), both kept raw so the JS can do unit-free
                        # math. Both are per ONE unit - multiply by qty at read time.
                        capture inclusion_pool_json
                          echo '[{"id":'
                          echo inclusion_variant.id | json
                          echo ',"product_id":'
                          echo inclusion_variant.product.id | json
                          echo ',"sku":'
                          echo inclusion_variant.sku | json
                          echo ',"title":'
                          echo inclusion_title | json
                          echo ',"image":'
                          echo inclusion_image_url | json
                          echo ',"price":'
                          echo inclusion_variant.price
                          echo ',"qty":'
                          echo inclusion_qty
                          echo ',"weight":'
                          echo inclusion_variant.weight
                          echo '}'

                          for pool_option in alternative_options
                            assign pool_variant = pool_option.variant.value

                            if pool_variant != blank
                              capture pool_qty_raw
                                echo pool_option.quantity
                              endcapture
                              assign pool_qty = pool_qty_raw | plus: 0
                              if pool_qty < 1
                                assign pool_qty = 1
                              endif

                              assign pool_title = pool_variant.product.title
                              unless pool_variant.title == 'Default Title'
                                assign pool_title = pool_title | append: ' - ' | append: pool_variant.title
                              endunless

                              assign pool_image = pool_variant.featured_image
                              if pool_image == blank
                                assign pool_image = pool_variant.product.featured_image
                              endif
                              assign pool_image_url = pool_image | image_url: width: 300

                              echo ',{"id":'
                              echo pool_variant.id | json
                              echo ',"product_id":'
                              echo pool_variant.product.id | json
                              echo ',"sku":'
                              echo pool_variant.sku | json
                              echo ',"title":'
                              echo pool_title | json
                              echo ',"image":'
                              echo pool_image_url | json
                              echo ',"price":'
                              echo pool_variant.price
                              echo ',"qty":'
                              echo pool_qty
                              echo ',"weight":'
                              echo pool_variant.weight
                              echo '}'

                              assign alternative_count = alternative_count | plus: 1
                            endif
                          endfor
                          echo ']'
                        endcapture
                      -%}
                      <div
                        class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__card"
                        data-gymbuild-item
                        data-item-id="{{ inclusion_variant.id }}"
                        data-item-product-id="{{ inclusion_variant.product.id }}"
                        data-item-sku="{{ inclusion_variant.sku | escape }}"
                        data-item-title="{{ inclusion_title | escape }}"
                        data-item-image="{{ inclusion_image_url }}"
                        data-item-price="{{ inclusion_variant.price }}"
                        data-item-qty="{{ inclusion_qty }}"
                        data-item-weight="{{ inclusion_variant.weight }}"
                        data-item-pool="{{ inclusion_pool_json | escape }}"
                        data-original-id="{{ inclusion_variant.id }}"
                        data-original-product-id="{{ inclusion_variant.product.id }}"
                        data-original-sku="{{ inclusion_variant.sku | escape }}"
                        data-original-title="{{ inclusion_title | escape }}"
                        data-original-image="{{ inclusion_image_url }}"
                        data-original-price="{{ inclusion_variant.price }}"
                        data-original-qty="{{ inclusion_qty }}"
                        data-original-weight="{{ inclusion_variant.weight }}"
                      >
                        <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__card-image-wrap">
                          {% if inclusion_image %}
                            {%- liquid
                              assign inclusion_image_alt = inclusion_image.alt | default: inclusion_title | escape
                            -%}
                            {{
                              inclusion_image
                              | image_url: width: 300
                              | image_tag:
                                loading: 'lazy',
                                widths: '150, 220, 300',
                                sizes: '150px',
                                alt: inclusion_image_alt,
                                class: 'gymbuild-customize-drawer__card-image'
                            }}
                          {% else %}
                            {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'gymbuild-customize-drawer__card-image placeholder-svg' }}
                          {% endif %}
                        </div>

                        <p class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__card-title">{{ inclusion_title }}</p>
                        <p class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__card-count" data-gymbuild-item-count>{{ inclusion_qty }} {{ inclusion_qty | pluralize: 'item', 'items' }}</p>

                        <button type="button" class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__swap-btn" data-gymbuild-swap-btn{% if alternative_count == 0 %} disabled{% endif %}>
                          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0 1 13.66-5.66M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-13.66 5.66" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                            <path d="M17 3v4h-4M7 21v-4h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                          </svg>
                          Swap
                        </button>
                      </div>
                    {% endif %}
                  {% endfor %}
                </div>
              </div>

              {%- liquid
                assign rendered_panels = rendered_panels | append: panel_token
                assign panel_index = panel_index | plus: 1
              -%}
            {% endunless %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__swap-view">
        <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__swap-current" data-gymbuild-swap-current></div>
        <p class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__panel-heading">Swap to:</p>
        <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__swap-grid" data-gymbuild-swap-grid></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__footer" data-base-price="{{ current_variant.price }}">
      <div class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__footer-row">
        <span class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__footer-label">Estimated equipment subtotal</span>
        <span class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__footer-price" data-gymbuild-subtotal>{{ current_variant.price | money }}</span>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="gymbuild-customize-drawer__submit" data-gymbuild-open-review>Request Quote Review</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</modal-dialog>

<style>
  /* ==================================================================
     TEMPORARY DEV BANNER — DELETE THIS WHOLE BLOCK (CSS START)
     Added 2026-09-21. Pairs with the .gymbuild-dev-banner markup above;
     delete both together. Duplicated verbatim in
     gymbuild-quote-review-popup.liquid because each popup carries its own
     style block — keep them identical while they exist.
     ================================================================== */
  .gymbuild-dev-banner {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1px solid #f3c9b8;
    border-left: 4px solid #d83d0e;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #fdf2ee;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #23232b;
  }

  .gymbuild-dev-banner__icon {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    line-height: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  .gymbuild-dev-banner strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  /* TEMPORARY DEV BANNER — DELETE THIS WHOLE BLOCK (CSS END) */

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    z-index: -1;
    background: rgba(35, 35, 43, 0.4);
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer[open] {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    z-index: 101;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__content {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 100%;
    /* Figma node 4539:86140: drawer frame is 704px of a 1440px reference
       viewport (x=736, width=704) — ~48.9%, i.e. half the screen. */
    width: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transform: translateX(100%);
    transition: transform 280ms ease;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .gymbuild-customize-drawer__content {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer[open] .gymbuild-customize-drawer__content {
    transform: translateX(0);
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #edeff3;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__title {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #23232b;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__back {
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    appearance: none;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #23232b;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__content.is-swap-view .gymbuild-customize-drawer__back {
    display: inline-flex;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__content.is-swap-view .gymbuild-customize-drawer__title {
    display: none;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__close {
    appearance: none;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    padding: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #23232b;
    line-height: 0;
  }

  /* icon-close.liquid hardcodes fill="#F2F2F2" (built for a dark
     background) — nearly invisible on this drawer's white background.
     Override just here rather than editing the shared snippet, which
     is used in 18+ other places across the theme. */
  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__close .icon-close path {
    fill: #23232b;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__body {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__swap-view {
    display: none;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__content.is-swap-view .gymbuild-customize-drawer__main-view {
    display: none;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__content.is-swap-view .gymbuild-customize-drawer__swap-view {
    display: block;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card-input {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card.is-selected {
    border-color: #d83d0e;
    border-width: 2px;
    padding: 11px;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card.is-soldout {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card-title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #23232b;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card-desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 16px;
    color: #808080;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__size-card-price {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #d83d0e;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e1df;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__tab {
    position: relative;
    appearance: none;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    min-width: max-content;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #23232b;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__tab::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: transparent;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__tab.is-active::after {
    background: #ef3b12;
  }

  .gymbuild-customize-drawer__panel-heading {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
